{"uid":"TH-MDES-20221223-PLATFORM-DECREE","issue_id":"digital-platform","titles":{"zh":"《数字平台服务业务监管皇家法令》(佛历 2565):运营前与年度向 ETDA 通知义务","th":"","en":"Royal Decree on the Supervision of Digital Platform Service Businesses B.E. 2565"},"summary_zh":"要求提供中介性质数字平台服务者在开业前及此后每年向 ETDA 通知业务信息;法令生效前已在运营者须在生效后 90 日内通知。适用于向泰国境内用户提供服务的平台,不论运营方所在地;境外平台达到特定条件须指定本地协调人。未通知或不遵守 ETDA 暂停命令可处最高 1 年监禁、10 万泰铢罚金或并罚。","instrument_ids":["disclosure","standards_licensing","enforcement"],"goal_ids":["order_security","consumer_protection"],"implementation_stage":"legal_form","subjects":["digital_platform","etda_notification"],"agency_ids":["mdes","etda"],"domain_ids":["digital","biz"],"legal_form_id":"decree","status_id":"in_force","direction":{"value":"tight","confidence":"high","method":"manual"},"doc_no":"พ.ร.ฎ. ธุรกิจบริการแพลตฟอร์มดิจิทัล 2565","gazette":{"series":"ก","volume":null,"part":"","page":null},"dates":{"resolved_at":null,"published_at":"2022-12-23","effective_from":"2023-08-01","effective_to":null,"comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"foreign_company","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"sme","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"consumer","stance":"support"}],"relations":[],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"多家律所与 IAPP 一致引述:2022-12-23 刊登公报,2023 年 8 月生效"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-11T01:10:00+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"med","doc_no":"low"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":false},"note":"生效日仅检索到「2023 年 8 月」,取月首;确切日期待公报原文核对"}
{"uid":"TH-PDPC-20231225-XBORDER-S28","issue_id":"pdpa-cross-border","titles":{"zh":"个人资料保护委员会公告:依 PDPA 第 28 条的跨境传输保护标准(白名单)","th":"","en":"PDPC Notification on Criteria under Section 28 of the PDPA"},"summary_zh":"依《个人资料保护法》B.E. 2562 第 28 条,规定将个人资料发送或传输至境外的保护标准,即所谓「白名单」机制 —— 目的地具备足够保护水平时可直接传输。","instrument_ids":["standards_licensing","disclosure"],"goal_ids":["consumer_protection","order_security"],"implementation_stage":"implementing_rule","subjects":["pdpa","cross_border_transfer"],"agency_ids":["pdpc"],"domain_ids":["digital"],"legal_form_id":"prakat","status_id":"in_force","direction":{"value":"tight","confidence":"high","method":"manual"},"doc_no":"ประกาศ คคส. (มาตรา 28) 2566","gazette":null,"dates":{"resolved_at":null,"published_at":"2023-12-25","effective_from":"2024-03-24","effective_to":null,"comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"foreign_company","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"sme","stance":"constrain"}],"relations":[{"type":"related","uid":"TH-PDPC-20231225-XBORDER-S29"}],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"Baker McKenzie / Lexology / DataGuidance 一致引述刊登日与生效日"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-11T01:10:00+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"high","doc_no":"low"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":false},"note":"公告泰文全称与编号待公报原文核对"}
{"uid":"TH-PDPC-20231225-XBORDER-S29","issue_id":"pdpa-cross-border","titles":{"zh":"个人资料保护委员会公告:依 PDPA 第 29 条的跨境传输保护标准(BCR 与适当保障措施)","th":"","en":"PDPC Notification on Criteria under Section 29 of the PDPA"},"summary_zh":"依《个人资料保护法》B.E. 2562 第 29 条,规定以集团内部约束性规则(BCR)与适当保障措施为基础的跨境传输路径,供目的地不在白名单时使用。","instrument_ids":["standards_licensing","disclosure"],"goal_ids":["consumer_protection","order_security"],"implementation_stage":"implementing_rule","subjects":["pdpa","cross_border_transfer","bcr"],"agency_ids":["pdpc"],"domain_ids":["digital"],"legal_form_id":"prakat","status_id":"in_force","direction":{"value":"tight","confidence":"high","method":"manual"},"doc_no":"ประกาศ คคส. (มาตรา 29) 2566","gazette":null,"dates":{"resolved_at":null,"published_at":"2023-12-25","effective_from":"2024-03-24","effective_to":null,"comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"foreign_company","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"sme","stance":"constrain"}],"relations":[{"type":"related","uid":"TH-PDPC-20231225-XBORDER-S28"}],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"同上"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-11T01:10:00+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"high","doc_no":"low"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":false},"note":""}
{"uid":"TH-MOL-20250701-MINWAGE-14","issue_id":"minimum-wage","titles":{"zh":"工资委员会最低工资公告(第 14 号):曼谷全行业日最低工资上调至 400 泰铢","th":"","en":"Wage Committee Notification on Minimum Wage Rates (No. 14)"},"summary_zh":"2025-06-17 工资委员会以三分之二多数通过,公告于 2025-07-01 刊登皇家公报并当日生效。曼谷全行业日最低工资 400 泰铢;其他府仅对特定业态适用 400 泰铢,包括《旅馆法》定义的第 2、3、4 类旅馆与《娱乐场所法》定义的娱乐场所。全国其余地区区间为 337–400 泰铢。","instrument_ids":["standards_licensing"],"goal_ids":["employment_skills"],"implementation_stage":"implementing_rule","subjects":["minimum_wage"],"agency_ids":["mol"],"domain_ids":["labor"],"legal_form_id":"prakat","status_id":"in_force","direction":{"value":"neutral","confidence":"high","method":"manual"},"doc_no":"ประกาศคณะกรรมการค่าจ้าง ฉบับที่ 14","gazette":{"series":"ง","volume":null,"part":"","page":null},"dates":{"resolved_at":"2025-06-17","published_at":"2025-07-01","effective_from":"2025-07-01","effective_to":null,"comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"thai_employer","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"sme","stance":"constrain"}],"relations":[],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"Nishimura & Asahi / ILCT / 劳工部英文新闻稿一致引述刊登日与生效日"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-11T01:10:00+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"high","doc_no":"med"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":true},"note":"政府宣示目标为 2027 年达 600 泰铢/日,后续调整待观察"}
{"uid":"TH-MOL-20251212-SSO-CEILING","issue_id":"social-security-ceiling","titles":{"zh":"劳工部部令:社会保障投保工资上限自 15,000 上调至 17,500 泰铢","th":"","en":"Ministerial Regulation raising the SSO contributable wage ceiling"},"summary_zh":"2025-12-12 刊登皇家公报,自 2026-01-01 起将第 33 条投保人的投保工资上限由每月 15,000 泰铢提高至 17,500 泰铢,单方最高月缴额由 750 泰铢升至 875 泰铢。上限自 1995 年冻结至今首次调整,并已排定分段上调:2029 年 20,000 泰铢、2032 年 23,000 泰铢。雇佣泰籍员工的企业需同步调整薪酬与社保基数。","instrument_ids":["standards_licensing","disclosure"],"goal_ids":["employment_skills","consumer_protection"],"implementation_stage":"implementing_rule","subjects":["social_security","contribution_ceiling"],"agency_ids":["mol","sso"],"domain_ids":["labor"],"legal_form_id":"ministerial","status_id":"in_force","direction":{"value":"tight","confidence":"high","method":"manual"},"doc_no":"","gazette":{"series":"ก","volume":null,"part":"","page":null},"dates":{"resolved_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-12","effective_from":"2026-01-01","effective_to":null,"comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"thai_employer","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"sme","stance":"constrain"}],"relations":[],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"HLB Thailand 等多家一致引述 2025-12-12 刊登、2026-01-01 生效与分段上调时间表"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-11T01:10:00+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"high","doc_no":"none"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":false},"note":"部令编号未取得,故 doc_no 留空"}
{"uid":"TH-DBD-2568-ORDER-2","issue_id":"nominee-crackdown","titles":{"zh":"商业发展厅令第 2/2568 号:新设公司登记须核查泰籍股东资金来源","th":"","en":"DBD Order No. 2/2568"},"summary_zh":"自 2026-01-01 起,新设泰国有限公司登记时,登记官须核查银行流水与资金来源文件。泰籍股东须提供三个月银行对账单以证明真实出资能力,并做到交易级别的对应核对。针对以名义出资额设立、泰籍「投资人」并无真实资金投入的空壳结构。","instrument_ids":["enforcement","disclosure","standards_licensing"],"goal_ids":["order_security"],"implementation_stage":"implementing_rule","subjects":["nominee_structure","company_registration","source_of_funds"],"agency_ids":["dbd"],"domain_ids":["biz","land"],"legal_form_id":"rabiap","status_id":"in_force","direction":{"value":"tight","confidence":"high","method":"manual"},"doc_no":"คำสั่ง กรมพัฒนาธุรกิจการค้า 2/2568","gazette":null,"dates":{"resolved_at":null,"published_at":null,"effective_from":"2026-01-01","effective_to":null,"comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"foreign_investor","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"foreign_company","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"sme","stance":"constrain"}],"relations":[{"type":"related","uid":"TH-DBD-2569-ORDER-1"}],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"One Asia Lawyers / FRANK Legal / PKF Thailand 等一致引述令号与施行日"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-11T01:10:00+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"med","doc_no":"high"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":false},"note":"部门令不刊公报,故 published_at 留空;施行日为广泛引述的 2026-01-01"}
{"uid":"TH-DBD-2569-ORDER-1","issue_id":"nominee-crackdown","titles":{"zh":"商业发展厅令第 1/2569 号:变更登记须提交投资确认函与真实投资声明","th":"","en":"DBD Order No. 1/2569"},"summary_zh":"自 2026-04-01 起,核查范围从新设扩展至变更登记 —— 股权转让、增资、董事变更均纳入,重点针对新增外籍股东/董事或改变股东与管理层国籍构成的申请。公司须按 DBD 公布的模板提交经签署的「投资确认函」并附银行证据,每名泰籍股东确认购股资金来源。新登记具签字权的外籍董事时,负责申报的董事还须提交「真实投资声明」,确认全体泰籍股东确以自有资金出资、非代持股东。","instrument_ids":["enforcement","disclosure","standards_licensing"],"goal_ids":["order_security"],"implementation_stage":"implementing_rule","subjects":["nominee_structure","share_transfer","investment_confirmation_letter"],"agency_ids":["dbd"],"domain_ids":["biz","land"],"legal_form_id":"rabiap","status_id":"in_force","direction":{"value":"tight","confidence":"high","method":"manual"},"doc_no":"คำสั่ง กรมพัฒนาธุรกิจการค้า 1/2569","gazette":null,"dates":{"resolved_at":null,"published_at":null,"effective_from":"2026-04-01","effective_to":null,"comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"foreign_investor","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"foreign_company","stance":"constrain"}],"relations":[{"type":"related","uid":"TH-DBD-2568-ORDER-2"}],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"同上;重点由「出资能力」转向「实际出资」是这一号令的核心变化"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-11T01:10:00+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"med","doc_no":"high"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":false},"note":"部门令不刊公报,故 published_at 留空"}
{"uid":"TH-CUSTOMS-20260101-DEMINIMIS","issue_id":"low-value-imports","titles":{"zh":"低价进口商品免税门槛取消:1 泰铢以上即征进口关税与 7% 增值税","th":"","en":"Abolition of the de minimis duty exemption for low-value imports"},"summary_zh":"自 2026-01-01 起取消长期适用的低价进口免税门槛(原为单批货值 1,500 泰铢以下),1 泰铢以上货物即征进口关税,并继续按 7% 征增值税;原免税安排最后适用日为 2025-12-31。此前已分两段先行开征增值税:2024-07-05 至 2024-12-31、2025-01-01 至 2025-12-31。政策目标是让本地中小企业与低价进口商品处于同一竞争条件,预计年增税收至少 30 亿泰铢。","instrument_ids":["trade_control","tax_incentive"],"goal_ids":["fiscal_revenue","industrial_upgrade"],"implementation_stage":"budget_execution","subjects":["low_value_goods","de_minimis","import_duty","vat"],"agency_ids":["customs","mof","rd"],"domain_ids":["customs","tax"],"legal_form_id":"prakat","status_id":"in_force","direction":{"value":"tight","confidence":"high","method":"manual"},"doc_no":"","gazette":null,"dates":{"resolved_at":null,"published_at":null,"effective_from":"2026-01-01","effective_to":null,"comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"importer","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"consumer","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"sme","stance":"support"}],"relations":[],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"EY / HLB Thailand / Sherrings 一致引述取消日与两段增值税过渡安排"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-11T01:10:00+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"high","doc_no":"none"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":false},"note":"具体承载文件(财政部/海关厅公告)编号未取得,故 doc_no 留空 —— 待公报核对后回填"}
{"uid":"TH-BOI-20260115-MEASURES-2026","issue_id":"boi-2026-measures","titles":{"zh":"BOI 新一轮投资促进措施:接替 2025 年到期方案,聚焦数据中心与 AI 基础设施","th":"","en":"BOI refreshed investment promotion measures (announced 15 January 2026)"},"summary_zh":"2026-01-15 公布,接替 2025 年到期的促进方案,覆盖先进制造与自动化、电动车与移动技术、高价值研发,并以云服务、数据中心及 AI 所需数字基础设施为最大重点。多数措施的申请窗口为 2026 年第一个工作日至 2027 年最后一个工作日,部分更早届满。数据中心类新增条件:三年内管理与专业岗位泰籍人员占比不低于 50%,并须开展培训、与院校共建课程、研发、提升本地中小企业能力等人力资源发展活动,完成后方可主张企业所得税豁免。","instrument_ids":["tax_incentive","local_content","training"],"goal_ids":["investment_attraction","industrial_upgrade","employment_skills"],"implementation_stage":"implementing_rule","subjects":["investment_incentive","data_centre","ai_infrastructure"],"agency_ids":["boi","mof"],"domain_ids":["biz","digital"],"legal_form_id":"prakat","status_id":"in_force","direction":{"value":"loose","confidence":"med","method":"manual"},"doc_no":"","gazette":null,"dates":{"resolved_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-15","effective_from":"2026-01-01","effective_to":"2027-12-31","comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"foreign_investor","stance":"support"},{"party_id":"foreign_company","stance":"support"},{"party_id":"local_government","stance":"neutral"}],"relations":[],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"Alvarez & Marsal / Nation Thailand 引述公布日与申请窗口;逐项公告编号未取得"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-11T01:10:00+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"med","doc_no":"none"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":false},"note":"这是一揽子措施的统称条目,不是单一公告;逐项 BOI 公告编号待回填后应拆分为多条"}
{"uid":"TH-IMM-20260801-THIM-MANDATORY","issue_id":"thim-entry-registration","titles":{"zh":"移民局 THIM 入境登记 App 于 2026 年 8 月起对所有外籍入境者强制启用","th":"","en":""},"summary_zh":"THIM(Thailand Immigration Management)将原 TDAC 入境卡整合进统一平台,首次登记后再次入境只需更新航班与到达日期。此前为试点期,THIM 与 TDAC 网页版并行受理;进入强制期后所有外籍入境者均须经 THIM 登记。具体强制启用日期以移民局公告为准。","instrument_ids":["public_service","disclosure"],"goal_ids":["order_security"],"implementation_stage":"budget_execution","subjects":["entry_registration","tdac"],"agency_ids":["imm"],"domain_ids":["visa","digital"],"legal_form_id":"guidance","status_id":"in_force","direction":{"value":"neutral","confidence":"low","method":"llm"},"doc_no":"","gazette":null,"dates":{"resolved_at":null,"published_at":null,"effective_from":"2026-08-01","effective_to":null,"comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"traveller","stance":"constrain"},{"party_id":"foreign_resident","stance":"constrain"}],"relations":[],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"公开检索聚合摘要,未取得官方公告链接"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-10T23:53:23+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"low","doc_no":"none"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":false},"note":"effective_from 仅精确到月,取月首;待官方公告回填"}
{"uid":"TH-CAB-20260519-VISAFREE-30D","issue_id":"visa-free-duration","titles":{"zh":"内阁决议:终止 60 天免签、多数国籍改回 30 天(截至 8 月初尚未刊登公报)","th":"","en":""},"summary_zh":"内阁于 2026-05-19 批准终止 60 天免签入境安排,多数国籍恢复为 30 天,须由内政部公告刊登皇家公报后满 15 日生效。截至 2026-08-03 相关公告尚未刊登,现行 60 天免签仍然有效 —— 这是「内阁决议已过、公报未刊」的典型窗口期,以公报刊登日为准。","instrument_ids":["standards_licensing"],"goal_ids":["order_security"],"implementation_stage":"cabinet_resolution","subjects":["visa_exemption","length_of_stay"],"agency_ids":["cabinet","moi"],"domain_ids":["visa"],"legal_form_id":"resolution","status_id":"pending_gazette","direction":{"value":"tight","confidence":"med","method":"llm"},"doc_no":"","gazette":null,"dates":{"resolved_at":"2026-05-19","published_at":null,"effective_from":null,"effective_to":null,"comment_deadline":null},"affected_parties":[{"party_id":"traveller","stance":"constrain"}],"relations":[],"sources":[{"role":"secondary","url":"","note":"公开检索聚合摘要,未取得内阁决议原文链接"}],"provenance":{"pipeline":"research","run_at":"2026-08-10T23:53:23+07:00","verified":false,"verified_at":null},"confidence":{"dates":"med","doc_no":"none"},"flags":{"has_detail_page":false},"note":"生效取决于内政部公告刊登日 + 15 日"}
